<p>President Trump said on March 24 that Iran had given the United States &quot;a very big present&quot; tied to oil, gas, and the Strait of Hormuz, though he did not say what the concession was. He told reporters the move convinced him that the U.S. was &quot;talking to the right people&quot; in Tehran, suggesting Washington sees an opening for diplomacy even as the regional conflict continues. The comments came a day after Trump delayed threatened U.S. attacks on Iran&#x27;s power plants and said Washington was negotiating with unspecified figures in Iran. Tehran, however, denied taking part in talks to end the war, which Al-Monitor said had entered its fourth week and disrupted global oil supplies moving through the strategically important Hormuz Strait. CBS also reported that Iran launched missiles toward Israel and other Gulf countries while Trump argued the Iranian leadership was close enough to defeat that it had little choice but to negotiate an end to the war.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/WDhLZy7KJ1fJC9R-QqW5I3125FyThcXKmkd_g4sMYpIQIeqU3lz2Xi5g9u6mpdC9VCYXvA11KEieLblRgrl6zVzPZS686YfqF3l_SDqQH4WVywlk_oS3Cx2jBN3CvZzd0w_9KHtYn9iak2mVy_6fstbXaC84C0vwZ7LkBqTs31mRTVw1uHqi8osuu-uPCMwIPZ7YiCq-VFoo3gqg' alt='President Donald Trump speaks to reporters on March 24, 2026, about Iran, oil and the Strait of Hormuz.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Specific route: NDTV reported that Trump said yes when asked whether the alleged concession was tied to the Strait of Hormuz, narrowing the issue to a specific shipping corridor rather than a broader energy gesture.</li><li>Leadership phrasing: PBS referred to &quot;Iran&#x27;s new leaders,&quot; while Al-Monitor said Trump did not identify the figures he said Washington was dealing with.</li><li>Different labels, same mystery: PBS and Al-Monitor called the development a &quot;present&quot; or &quot;gift,&quot; while The Straits Times described it as a &quot;major energy-related concession,&quot; reflecting how little concrete detail Trump provided publicly.</li><li>From escalation to diplomacy: Al-Monitor said the announcement followed Trump&#x27;s surprise decision to postpone threatened attacks on Iran&#x27;s power plants, making the comment part of a rapid shift in U.S. messaging.</li></ul><blockquote>We got a very big present from Iran today, worth a tremendous amount of money - President Donald Trump</blockquote><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>President Donald Trump: Trump described the development as financially significant and as a sign that his team had found effective interlocutors in Tehran. (<a href='https://www.pbs.org/newshour/politics/watch-trump-says-irans-new-leaders-gave-us-a-present-related-to-oil-and-strait-of-hormuz'>PBS NewsHour</a>)</li><li>Iranian authorities: Tehran did not publicly confirm Trump&#x27;s account of either war-ending talks or the purported concession, leaving the U.S. description unverified from the Iranian side. (<a href='https://www.al-monitor.com/originals/2026/03/trump-says-iran-gave-us-gift-linked-strait-hormuz'>Al-Monitor</a>)</li><li>CBS News framing: CBS placed Trump&#x27;s claim alongside continuing missile launches, underscoring that any diplomatic opening was still taking shape amid active combat. (<a href='https://www.cbsnews.com/video/trump-says-iran-gave-us-a-very-big-present-related-to-oil-and-gas/'>CBS News</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.pbs.org/newshour/politics/watch-trump-says-irans-new-leaders-gave-us-a-present-related-to-oil-and-strait-of-hormuz'>WATCH: Trump says Iran&#x27;s new leaders &#x27;gave us a present&#x27; related to oil and Strait of Hormuz</a> - pbs.org</li><li><a href='https://www.cbsnews.com/video/trump-says-iran-gave-us-a-very-big-present-related-to-oil-and-gas/'>Trump says Iran gave U.S. &quot;a very big present&quot; related to oil and gas</a> - cbsnews.com</li><li><a href='https://www.al-monitor.com/originals/2026/03/trump-says-iran-gave-us-gift-linked-strait-hormuz'>Trump says Iran gave US &#x27;gift&#x27; linked to Strait of Hormuz</a> - al-monitor.com</li><li><a href='https://www.straitstimes.com/world/middle-east/trump-us-is-talking-to-the-right-people-in-iran-says-tehran-badly-wants-deal'>Trump says Iran made a major energy-related gift to the US</a> - straitstimes.com</li><li><a href='https://www.ndtv.com/world-news/iran-war-news-inside-irans-very-big-hormuz-related-oil-and-gas-present-for-donald-trump-11262584#publisher=newsstand'>Trump Says Iran Gave US A Hormuz &#x27;Gift&#x27; Related To &#x27;Oil, Gas&#x27;</a> - ndtv.com</li></ul>